        "explanation": "Doctor created an executable transition to the responsible inpatient team and anesthesia discussion.",
        "quote": "帮您联系病区"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00149",
        "explanation": "The handoff/action plan was actually picked up by the inpatient team.",
        "quote": "病区团队已接续术前知情同意和排台核对"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00153",
        "explanation": "Patient confirmed he would not leave to delay and had a concrete final question list.",
        "quote": "我现在不准备退院回家拖了"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00022",
        "explanation": "The red-flag screen covered neurologic change but not the required limb perfusion items, leaving a blocking residual safety gap.",
